me":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","review_id":"gFs8wspZva_KVbghreqNTw","date":"2020-07-03T02:53:30","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368442296981812,"text_excerpt":"Sheeeeesh. Chef Matt is working it at Yo Nashi. If you're coming here expecting authentic Japanese omakase - leave those expectations at the door. As the owner, Kyle, would say, \"It's New Orleans omakase, not omakase in New Orleans.\" $89 for omakase (chef's choice). I left super full and super satisfied. The menu has smaller changes daily, but weekly they will have larger changes depending on what they can source for the week. I had an amazing tomato bisque. It was light and refreshing. And the cucumbers gave it a good crunch. The most memorable dish during my meal was the tartare. Accompanied with Compressed watermelon that was extra sweet and paired well with the tartare. Everything els..."},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","review_id":"EK4cSWEJ3bQUn0pdjDCz5g","date":"2020-12-29T17:48:01","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9291325807571411,"text_excerpt":"Go to your bar, make a drink and prepare to read a true review of Yo Nashi. After reading the mixed reviews on food quantity I had some doubts but I am here to tell you there is no shortage in quantity of food. Perhaps if you sit at Cracker Barrel and eat their large chicken fried steak weekly you could leave Yo Nashi hungry. However, it was 10 portions served with the utmost attention to detail and flavor. Chef Mack was a great guy. I asked a ton of questions as I think all people who love food should. He mentioned he had worked at Commanders and it showed. I can't say enough how his attention to detail made the meal extravagant. As we left I told him it was in my Top 10 meals ever and t..."},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","review_id":"TppOmKouweUQRiLB6u06yw","date":"2021-07-20T16:32:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9282704591751099,"text_excerpt":"This is what they mean by food porn y'all. I seriously felt like having a glass of whiskey with a cigarette after the meal because it was that good. I don't even smoke cigarettes but I'd happily light one just to have a Pulp Fiction moment to show my gratitude to the chef. By far one of the best meals I've had in New Orleans. You are coming here for an experience that will blow your damn mind away and over stimulate your taste buds. Yo Nashi is an omakase restaurant, so think of it as multiple tastings with set courses decided by the chef and their team. I highly recommend grabbing a reservation ahead of time because this is a very intimate experience. You're sitting right across from the..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","photo_id":"PpfmeDIu10UgFWVvTvWoxA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/PpfmeDIu10UgFWVvTvWoxA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9130561351776123},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","photo_id":"ryukrfdB0Cbdkpir7qlcYw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ryukrfdB0Cbdkpir7qlcYw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9118068218231201},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","photo_id":"KoGiesJ9E2sLncMtP_JWrg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/KoGiesJ9E2sLncMtP_JWrg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9027713537216187},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","photo_id":"CR-1s0TnKkFqxMvUTkRtfw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/CR-1s0TnKkFqxMvUTkRtfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8532576560974121},{"business_id":"JOTAQZPCqpD6Nr7dsN9MYA","photo_id":"CO8NcIdblrHed91qqPye4w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/CO8NcIdblrHed91qqPye4w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8427335023880005}]},"notebook_case":null}
